    "updated_at": "2026-11-07T16:04:22Z",
    "body": "Update to my comment above: Andon's opt-in tool mode (`CLAIM_CHECK_EVIDENCE=tool`) no longer credits a run from before the last edit. If an Edit, Write, MultiEdit or NotebookEdit call comes after the passing run, that run stops counting until the tests run again. It still can't see files changed through Bash (`sed -i`, a script). Change: https://github.com/PrimeFoldTools/Andon/pull/27",
